<title>SPAIN: FORECAST - Tabacalera 9-mth net seen down 10 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Tabacalera 9-mth net seen down 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estimates of nine-month results for Spain's Tabacalera group. Market forecasts based on simple averages (figures in billions of pesetas).</p>
<p>			     Jan-Sept 96  Jan-Sept 95*   RANGE Sales</p>
<p>586.22	 552.52     577.33-597.40 Attributable net profit</p>
<p>8.39	   9.28	 7.50-9.56</p>
<p>Contributors: Argentaria Bolsa, Ahorro Corporacion, Benito y Monjardin, Credit Lyonnais Securities.</p>
<p>The company expects to announce results this week.</p>
<p>*Official company figures from last year.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585 2160</p>
</text>
